#: data/io.github.noctqira.Anemobit.desktop.in.in:2
msgid "Anemobit"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.noctqira.Anemobit.desktop.in.in:3
#: data/io.github.noctqira.Anemobit.metainfo.xml.in.in:7
msgid "Real-time interface traffic of devices over SNMP"
msgstr "透過 SNMP 即時監控設備的介面流量"

#. Translators: Search terms to find this application. Do NOT translate or localize the semicolons. The list MUST also end with a semicolon!
#: data/io.github.noctqira.Anemobit.desktop.in.in:10
msgid "SNMP;traffic;bandwidth;network;"
msgstr "SNMP;traffic;bandwidth;network;流量;頻寬;網路;"

#: data/io.github.noctqira.Anemobit.metainfo.xml.in.in:9 src/about.rs:15
msgid ""
"Works with devices that provide the standard IF-MIB with 64-bit interface "
"counters over SNMPv2c or SNMPv3 (authentication: MD5, SHA1, SHA224, SHA256, "
"SHA384, SHA512; privacy: DES, AES-128)."
msgstr ""
"適用於透過 SNMPv2c 或 SNMPv3（認證：MD5、SHA1、SHA224、SHA256、SHA384、"
"SHA512；加密：DES、AES-128）提供標準 IF-MIB 與 64 位元介面計數器的設備。"

#: data/io.github.noctqira.Anemobit.gschema.xml.in:43
msgid "Whether the hint about a missing system tray was shown"
msgstr "是否已顯示過找不到系統匣的提示"

#: data/io.github.noctqira.Anemobit.gschema.xml.in:50
msgid "Device address (IPv4, IPv6 or host name)"
msgstr "設備位址（IPv4、IPv6 或主機名稱）"

#: data/io.github.noctqira.Anemobit.gschema.xml.in:57
msgid "Monitored interfaces (ifName), in display order"
msgstr "監控的介面（ifName），依顯示順序"

#: data/io.github.noctqira.Anemobit.gschema.xml.in:77
msgid "Refresh interval in seconds (1, 5 or 10)"
msgstr "更新速率，以秒為單位（1、5 或 10）"

#: data/io.github.noctqira.Anemobit.gschema.xml.in:84
msgid "Interface shown in the system tray and the compact window"
msgstr "系統匣與精簡小視窗顯示的介面"

#: data/io.github.noctqira.Anemobit.gschema.xml.in:91
msgid ""
"Show charts on interface cards when two or more interfaces are monitored"
msgstr "監控兩個以上介面時，在介面卡片上顯示圖表"

#: data/io.github.noctqira.Anemobit.gschema.xml.in:95
msgid "Download color as #RRGGBB; empty for the theme default"
msgstr "下載的顏色（#RRGGBB）；空白表示使用主題預設色"

#: data/io.github.noctqira.Anemobit.gschema.xml.in:99
msgid "Upload color as #RRGGBB; empty for the theme default"
msgstr "上傳的顏色（#RRGGBB）；空白表示使用主題預設色"

#: data/io.github.noctqira.Anemobit.gschema.xml.in:104
msgid "Background opacity of the main window (0–1)"
msgstr "主視窗背景的不透明度（0–1）"

#: data/io.github.noctqira.Anemobit.gschema.xml.in:109
msgid "Background opacity of the window opened from the system tray (0–1)"
msgstr "系統匣小視窗背景的不透明度（0–1）"

#: data/io.github.noctqira.Anemobit.gschema.xml.in:113
msgid ""
"Display language (en, zh_TW, ja or ko); empty to follow the system. Takes "
"effect after a restart"
msgstr "顯示語言（en、zh_TW、ja 或 ko）；空白表示跟隨系統。重新啟動後生效"

